    {
      "text": "City report: demolition of the existing office building; Moffett Park Specific Plan area. The Pacific Companies and Miramar Capital are co-general partners. The site, owned by a Miramar subsidiary, transfers to Safehold at construction financing close and is ground leased to the partnership for 99 years. About $58 million of the gap is to come from tax-exempt bonds and the Safehold investment; the $14 million city award equals about $45,000 per unit.",
